        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 3:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka imwe timuri mu buryo bw'omubiri, kureka omu Mwoyo, Omwoyo wa Ruhanga ku araabe atuura omuriimwe buzima. Mumanye ngu omuntu weena otaine Mwoyo wa Kristo, ti muntu we na kakye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.2.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 2:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Kristo ku araabe ari omuriimwe, biri omubiri gufiire ahabw'ekibi, kwonka omwoyo guhuriire ahabw'okuhikiirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku muraabe mutuurwamu Omwoyo w'Ogwo owaazoire Yusu omu bafu, Ogwo owaazoire Kristo Yesu omu bafu aryahindura n'emibiri yaanyu ey'okufa okuba ehuriire ahabw'Omwoyo we otuura omuriimwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "B'eishe-emwe, twine eibanja, ti ry'omubiri ngu tukuratire ebyagwo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.4.22+EPH.4.23+EPH.4.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Efe 4:22-24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ahakuba ku muraakuratire eby'omubiri, nimwija kufa; kwonka ku muraitse Omwyo emicwe yaanyu ey'omubiri, muryaba abahuriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manya, boona abeebemberwa Omwoyo wa Ruhanga, nibo baana ba Ruhanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TI.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tim 1:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.4.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 4:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.4.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ahakuba timurahairwe mwoyo gw'obuhuuku kugaruka kutiina, kureka mukaheebwa Omwoyo owaabahindwire abaana ba Ruhanga, otugambisa tukagira tuti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abba, amakuru gaakyo ngu: Taata.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abba, Taata! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwoyo ogwo niwe ahamya n'emyoyo yaitu ku turi abaana ba Ruhanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.4.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 4:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi ku turaabe turi abaana, turi abahunguzi, abahunguzi ba Ruhanga, kandi ab'okuhungura hamwe na Kristo, ku turaabe nitushaasha hamwe nawe, ngu tubone kuheebwa ekitiinisa hamwe nawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
