          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Yoh 3:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ahabw'okuba ebihangirwe ebyo nabyo biryacungurwa, birekye kuba eby'okujunda, kureka biheebwe obusingye bw'abaana ba Ruhanga obw'ekitiinisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitumanya ngu ebihangirwe byona bituura nibitsinda, nibisaasira hamwe n'okuhitsya hati; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.5.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 5:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi tibyo byonka, kureka naitwe abaine ebyana by'omujigaijo eby'Omwoyo, nitutsinda omu mitima yaitu, nitutegyereza kuhindurwa abaana ba Ruhanga, nikwo kucungurwa kw'emibiri yaitu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahakuba tukajunwa twine amatsiko ago. Manya, eki omuntu aineho amatsiko, ku aheza kukireeba, gaba gatakiri matsiko. Mbwenu n'oha ogira amatsiko aha ki arikureeba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ku tugira amatsiko aha ki tutakareebire, tukitegyereza n'okugumisiriza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
